  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Meanwhile, to a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Cut potato into fries and place on the lined oven tray. Sprinkle with garlic seasoning and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat and bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cf4078645a16b947c54d3-6ceef417.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice tomato into wedges.\n• Grate carrot.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cf4078645a16b947c54d3-a12a90d9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When fries have 5 mins remaining, drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm slices.\n• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a medium frying pan over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi in batches with a splash of water until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side. Remove from heat, add the honey and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) and turn to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cf4078645a16b947c54d3-b313fddb.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine salad leaves, tomato, carrot, a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season and toss to combine.\n• Divide chilli honey-glazed haloumi, garlicky fries and tomato salad between plates.\n• Serve with the mayonnaise.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cf4078645a16b947c54d3-c446fb87.jpeg"
    }
  ]
